          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-09-20 · Flow created from the blank starter. Vendored kit 0.1.1 (37 variables: the kit's 34, kit-version-source, plus shell-surface-UNTOKENISED and nav-active-UNTOKENISED held flow-local because the kit has no name for them — see D19). Mirrored Admin / Overview / Default against src/admin/views/pages/overview.html at 6cfefe0, after the period selector was removed and both charts moved onto one time axis. Two token values were found invalid while vendoring: status-ok-fill and overlay-scrim were stored as rgba(), which the .pen schema does not accept. Fixed in both files; the kit bumped to 0.1.1.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono-render",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
